  "notes": [
    "Header block (rows 5-21) is identical in content/addresses to artist-settlement -- same binding logic, same offer_id lookup.",
    "This sheet's own row numbers differ slightly from ARTIST_SETTLEMENT's (TICKET AUDIT starts 1 row earlier here) -- built fresh against this sheet's actual addresses, not copy-pasted.",
    "Bonus (L72) and Rebate to Promoter (L81) are the same concept in the source (L72=L81) -- both bound to settlement.ticketing_fees * settlement.service_fee_rebate_pct (the real, current mechanism for handing back part of the service fee as a deal term, per lib/settlement/model.ts's artistPayout()). NOT settlement.ticketing_rebate, a separate legacy field that's unrelated venue-side ticketing revenue and never reaches the artist.",
    "% of Rebate to Venue (L82) and Cash Sales (L83) have no corresponding real Settlement field and no confirmed formula -- left blank rather than guessing at financial figures. Flagged for Matt.",
    "TOTAL REVENUE (L85) and P&L (L87) are bound directly to the real, already-computed settlement.venue_total_revenue / settlement.venue_net_profit (same fields the admin page computes) rather than re-deriving the sheet's own GBOR+Rebate+CashSales+MerchToVenue-Expenses chain -- guarantees the bottom-line P&L always matches the app's real number. Expenses (Incl. Artist) (L86) is shown as the residual (Revenue - P&L) so the three cells always reconcile."
  ],
